Error [E0070]: this uses a retired arrow spelling
  --> tests/ui/cell_guard_capture.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     return () => guard.get()
    |               ^^
 Why: callables, arms, and lambdas use one arrow: `->`
 Fix: replace `:>` or `=>` with `->`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0070

Error [E0217]: Cell guard `guard` cannot be captured by a lambda
  --> tests/ui/cell_guard_capture.jet:3:12
    |
  3 |     return () => guard.get()
    |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: a Cell guard is a temporary loan handle; storing it inside another value could keep the loan after its local scope ends
 Fix: keep the guard in a local name or a tuple, and use `.map(...)` or `.split(...)` for projections
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0217
